Open opencode with a model

Usage: wally opencode [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        Passed through to opencode

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your account
      --cloud                 Use your account's hosted endpoint (never a local model)

Examples:
  wally opencode -m qwen3-0.6b                  A model on this machine
  wally opencode --cloud -m glm-5.3-flash       A hosted model (needs `wally account login`)
